        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ਵਿਛੜਨਾ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਵਿਛੜਨਾ — vichhaṛnā — \"to get separated; to go astray\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਭੀੜ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਾਡੇ ਤੋਂ ਨਾ ਵਿਛੜੋ। bhīṛ vich sāḍe ton nā vichhṛo. Do not get separated from us in the crowd."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ਮੈਂ ਦੋਸਤਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਵਿਛੜਿਆ, maiṁ dostāṁ ton vichhṛiā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਵਿਛੜਨਾ (vichhaṛnā) is inherited from a reconstructed vicchaṭ, \"be separated\"; CDIAL lists Punjabi vicchaṛṇā, \"to be separated, go astray\", under it (CDIAL 11687)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
